# Domain Service Architecture Patterns

## Domain Architecture Overview

This project uses domain-driven design with each entity having its own domain module containing both repository and service layers.

### Domain Structure
- [apps/web/src/domain/base.ts](mdc:apps/web/src/domain/base.ts) - Base repository and service classes with performance optimizations
- [apps/web/src/domain/user.ts](mdc:apps/web/src/domain/user.ts) - User domain (repository + service)
- [apps/web/src/domain/project.ts](mdc:apps/web/src/domain/project.ts) - Project domain with relationship management
- [apps/web/src/domain/task.ts](mdc:apps/web/src/domain/task.ts) - Task domain with status management
- [apps/web/src/domain/comment.ts](mdc:apps/web/src/domain/comment.ts) - Comment domain
- [apps/web/src/domain/index.ts](mdc:apps/web/src/domain/index.ts) - Domain factory and centralized creation

